              "name": "SoCalguy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made an apple pie the other day for a dinner with friends. I didn't want to have all that 'crust', so I found this recipe and I tried it. It was a great topping for the pie. I am going to experiment using different fillings, ie.....cherry, peach, rhubarb, mixed berries, etc....it is going to be great!"
