              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used a small Granny Smith apple in this recipe (I didn't have a dried apple)\nand added a little pumpkin pie spice. I baked it in the oven for about 20-25 minutes and I plan on letting it cool and use it for a topping on the Dreamy Apple Butter Pumpkin Pie. I'm crossing my fingers it's a good combination.",
